      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَصْعَقَتْهُ الصَّاعِقَةُ</span></b>  <i>The</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صاعقة</span> [or <i>thunderbolt</i>]
<i>smote him.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اصعقهُ</span> <i>He,</i> or <i>it,
